description:
hurricane report (now that we have more reliable internet):
-several shingle pieces blown off;
-fallen branch landed on incoming communication lines, ripping the fascia/gutter away from the roof/soffit (can see into roof from below now);
- during hurricane, water started leaking into the house from the bay window - this was alleviated by adjusting the soffit outside so water could escape there instead;
- water in the back yard/patio was several inches deep.  it did not seep into house as far as we can tell but it was within a half an inch from the back door
